"Word, Excel and PowerPoint: LibreOffice Writer, Calc and Impress. They open "
"and save Office files."
msgstr ""
"Word, Excel und PowerPoint: LibreOffice Writer, Calc und Impress. Sie öffnen "
"und speichern Office-Dateien."

